    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114332" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολ-άω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολή</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be full of black bile,
				to be melancholy mad,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράσιν πείθει χολῶσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					833
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Epicr.
				5.7
			</span></i>, Strato <i><span class="en">
				1.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				176
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολόομαι</span>
			, <i>to be angry, rage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				334
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				9.66
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				3.1
			</span></i>; 
				Ep.
			
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χολόων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Th.</u>
					140
				</span></i>
			.</div>
